 ime\n4:00 PM ET  |  20:00 UTC\n\nQuarter-end close. Positions held at th
 is moment are what gets disclosed in the 13F filings roughly six weeks l
 ater.\n\nPositions held at this close are what appears in the November f
 ilings. Also quarter-end\, so rebalancing flows are in the tape.\n\nREME
 MBER THE LAG. A 13F shows positions as of the QUARTER-END date\, not the
  filing date - roughly six weeks stale on arrival. A fund that held some
 thing on the snapshot date may already be out of it. Good for spotting m
 ulti-quarter accumulation and understanding a manager's approach\; usele
 ss as a short-term signal.
